{"v":4,"catch":"衝撞速度！ \n在 MOTOS 中全速前進。","desc":"《MOTOS》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1985年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制“MOTORSPANNER”裝甲車並撞擊所有“SPACE BEES”以將它們從基地上擊落。\n在開始階段之前從 2 種類型的加電部件中進行選擇，以提高你推倒敵人的能力，或提高你的跳躍能力。 嘗試選擇適合那個階段的那個！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-06-09","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2a44b9cd5d65bdcd5fa187269f0cacc9d94cb5ddc6a6c5fc9672a0dd50f727cf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f16b8160cc96b549601be9275a70e58f465aa1406cbd2d449761cf25c9fe2a62.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5035052ea79b3e81400a349c89729227a304c008f590e86f80999415eba2f197.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1fdddf726b8b6cd31da6bc9a6e1ac6c2f852fc0d6dc338fe039a334c5b6abbc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ad7fd3c36cd0edfaf919739faca220dffbf38434ee697df9f78be4f2433eeb1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f621d54e7e0be0b436ec420ecedc24c5e70e22a0fba44083dfebdf1aee413f0.jpg"],"titleId":"010065a0178ee000","dlc":[]}